    "- Use donor stores `Store_2` through `Store_10` to construct the counterfactual for `Store_1`.\n",
    "- Optimize synthetic weights $\\mathbf{W}^*$ on weeks 1–35 ($T_0 = 35$).\n",
    "- Expected post-treatment causal quantity impact: $\\approx -22.5\\%$.\n",
    "\n",
    "### To Member 4 (Double Machine Learning Lead):\n",
    "- Primary specification: $Y = \\text{log\\_units}$, $T = \\text{log\\_price}$.\n",
    "- Orthogonalize against verified adjustment set: `['log_competitor_price', 'total_marketing_spend', 'avg_store_footfall', 'holiday_days']`.\n",
    "- Ground truth benchmark: $\\hat{\\theta} \\approx -1.50$."
   ]
